    "description": "Family designated the PR Series, comprising the PR PLUS-B and PR PLUS-P models. Class III, mains or battery-operated, self-indicating, price-computing, dual-interval, non-automatic weighing instruments designed for direct sales to the public. Plastic construction; operator's keypad; stainless steel load receptor; base-mounted operator and customer LED displays (PR PLUS-B); pole-mounted operator and customer LED displays (PR PLUS-P); level indicator. Devices: initial zero setting device, semi-automatic zero setting device, zero tracking device, zero indicator, net indicator, stable weight indicator, low battery indicator, semi-automatic subtractive tare balancing device, gravity compensation, price-computing, PLU, calibration/set-up mode via sealed internal switch. Interfaces: none. Seals: calibration and setup parameters can only be accessed via the sealed switch located on the main board."
